  "id": "USN-8233-1",
  "summary": "nghttp2 vulnerability",
  "details": "Andrew MacPherson discovered that nghttp2 did not properly validate\ninternal state when the session termination API was called. A remote\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause nghttp2 to crash, resulting\nin a denial of service.",
